{"title":"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9dc87c5ffe3bdc3491d0b1305cf5acb1d9bbace.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A}*\\text{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/7/87774a0ddc93f2df91a9a9cdacb70c0e8c5e3227.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\text{A}+\\text{B}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"48\" height=\"37\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/005c477018a9ba5f3e6710cccf141d64ee138115.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3*5)*8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0ba7d8b1a14897e62a48614448e19e461d4fc29a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 16\\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluating yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/a/90aa055139cc40d0009979af5651c9eb71ea31a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3*5)*8 = \\left( \\frac{3+5}{2}\\right) * 8 = 4*8 = \\frac{4+8}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"406\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME\" title=\"1986 AJHSME\">1986 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem